s ben harmon crying i  usually only cry like this after i  masturbate which is what he did in  season one it's kind of funny she  doesn't immediately recognize him as ben  harmon after just binge watching the  entire season ben tells her that murder  house is hell he's stuck here blaming  others and not himself he mentions  hayden the woman he had an affair with  from season one played by kate mara he  says he's even talked to another  therapist about his problems referring  to episode 1's dr andy grant who was  later killed michelle says the people  who are trapped here are probably stuck  because they never resolved their issues  when they were alive but as ruby tells  her some ghosts don't want to leave they  just want to see others suffer michelle  ends up being killed by the rubber woman  which scarlett is dressed up as a year  later on halloween the ghost of michelle  visits her son who is once again pissed  off at her still harboring resentment  that she lied about where she was going  last halloween and buying murder house  he mentions that her only way to escape  is through fire but if he burns the  house down she'll be gone forever and  that's what he'll end up doing on the  morning after halloween the ghosts are  brought back to murder house and here we  can see one of the girls spending her  last moments with her brother who we  also saw in episode 2 of this season i  don't think we've ever seen this before  but correct me if i'm wrong once the sun  rises if a ghost is not in murder house  they are transported back which is what  we see happen here with ruby nonetheless  this is a moot point as we'll find out  this is all a video game but we'll get  to that in a bit rory comes down the  street rolling a wheelbarrow filled to  the brim with canisters of gasoline  which is just hilarious and michelle  watches as we get a very brief cameo of  the therapist from episode 1. ruby wants  to stomp and kill rory when ben and the  girls put an end to her allowing 